#: scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf59d6956d3fcba734796f878a2fa0b29c6883aa8c9b5ebc7435c16028e261e5
#. default-sha256: 6eed5e4c64cd4d084c2126cd814d5583baa0db9a870b5c7d7950d515863dc41c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2C7D3222_5934_4016_90AC_223BF146B92B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This is something that actually happened to another maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Je vais te raconter ce qui est arrivé à une autre servante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9148bb074f7cac082dc118020c97bfdb412c7b449b9afe518a42718678caf05c
#. default-sha256: 86b99045cb29a37c57e6db06e679dc99eeb8e05f448fd6b6bfa8252c2df52eac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CEB649_C9D5_44D6_A3C4_652322264F3A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She heard a sound in the middle of the night.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A sound like dripping water."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle a entendu un bruit au milieu de la nuit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Un bruit comme de l’eau qui goutte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8307c7edbd2ad948c8d348d95e4e1e09e66cd2712eeab396f0bba2411985cae6
#. default-sha256: 196fe0d3ffe629339b6f0d7da9c99c4e6c0c6ef91fadd7a2bf3fa95f03f2cf76
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A67DF01_8DFF_43AF_A2C2_35B87AD7EB02"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At first, ⟪k:3⟫she thought it was raining, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫so she looked through the "
"window, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫and there wasn’t a cloud in the sky to cover the stars."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Au début, ⟪k:3⟫elle croyait qu’il pleuvait, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫donc elle a regardé par la "
"fenêtre, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫mais il n’y avait pas un seul nuage dans le ciel."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31dfd37ad0f64ebcf3a25516b829b38b5582d513c4064feb2b7420735bcd32c8
#. default-sha256: 033748c82ca41fceb80d20e7977de6723badaee6c846c20828a694155452eaec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3A408E97_2ABA_4550_BE7E_A0D2A4BFEE38"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Maybe it’s a faucet,” ⟪k:1⟫she thought, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫so she stepped out of her room and into "
"the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Peut-être que c’est un robinet », ⟪k:1⟫s’est-elle dit, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫alors elle est sortie de "
"sa chambre pour aller dans le couloir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeea436698b98c8f1f24486fce3404352e6e0fa067bf6be4d834eb962e1a9988
#. default-sha256: c890b46c098fbdb284e8c9ff9097c87748f190d82ddefd2c5fdf078933822062
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3C8694F4_1F6B_46ED_82AE_92B8AA9511A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Compared to her room, ⟪k:1⟫it was unearthly chilly.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The maid regretted not bringing "
"something to cover herself with."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Par rapport à sa chambre, ⟪k:1⟫l’air était étrangement glacial.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La servante a "
"regretté de ne pas avoir apporté quelque chose pour se couvrir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d23ab85b13377db4eb5e5fa9578849015b9686548ce624c27bcacc53e6a3b81
#. default-sha256: 06304b572eb95ed8230fa6f535d22058d99eb85cb29ae3ea6f6926717caf5c78
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE7EB345_D841_41BD_93D3_6E517DC6B2BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that didn’t make any sense.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Normally, ⟪k:3⟫the temperature wasn’t that much "
"colder outside her room. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Her nightclothes had always been more than enough for a trip "
"to the lavatory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ça n’avait aucun sens.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Normalement, ⟪k:3⟫la température n’était pas bien plus "
"froide en-dehors de sa chambre. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sa robe de nuit avait toujours été largement suffisante "
"pour un voyage aux toilettes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad75afe8d5ba3cf770ef031116c75cd86be25dc792d1f72b5df25207cebc4bb8
#. default-sha256: d3392fea85ce5acadbfdca520665b0d131e4ee41d09afcba0bc2c5ec4210cef5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B5C1B330_DFCF_4896_B0FA_A84711D1E677"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wondering what the reason could be,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫she made her way toward the sound—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but then, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫she realized something:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En se demandant comment cela se faisait,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫elle s’est dirigée vers le bruit—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫mais c’est alors ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫qu’elle s’est rendu compte de quelque chose :"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 899c03554e2e515c4d416885825976f36a356deb6283724b13bb842e4595c552
#. default-sha256: 0a12db27d236d0313fff534eb7f4b0549d8ef0619b3484c01c58ddf822843cf5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6143D13_CF25_4EA4_97D8_20051D8A390F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were no faucets in the direction she was going.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Rather, ⟪k:4⟫she was "
"headed toward a hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫il n’y avait pas de robinet vers où elle allait.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Car ⟪k:4⟫elle se dirigeait "
"vers un couloir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83e9244989370eeb56aad6ea4cc2c14b0f9ab958c647fd746189c0e3e246865a
#. default-sha256: 2612f6213461b4ae18eccf0500d45a4355e4569cf1bbefc0791f4ccbbc25b5dd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B208F65A_77B9_432F_9AE2_D2921AE1D586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion where she served had many halls,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but this one was off in a far "
"corner of the house—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫the least used hall of them all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le manoir où elle servait avait de nombreux couloirs,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mais celui-ci était dans "
"un coin éloigné de la maison—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫c’était le moins utilisé d’entre tous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 524a4d733411099794ac12729e0d01442edbbffa0e7313c9ac241df64979defa
#. default-sha256: 5db682b20fe9adadfacf82452864f20472d72a534bbc96d19c21792e74488767
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_63382F56_7DA6_48AD_BDED_119E35E45464"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It had a high roof, ⟪k:3⟫but not a lot of space, ⟪k:4⟫so it was difficult to make "
"good use of. ⟪k:5⟫It also had a somewhat heavy air to it—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫a very curious room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il avait un haut plafond, ⟪k:3⟫mais il n’était pas très grand, ⟪k:4⟫donc il était "
"difficile d’en faire bon usage. ⟪k:5⟫L’atmosphère était aussi assez pesante—⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫ "
"c’était un lieu très étrange."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 953e3ddc77191b19509e0beb6c68d5ef2ac723d6140432a397abca104a7551eb
#. default-sha256: 0371c2da343655ff84870cc48673e3469c4d6a3efdcc5d6f92d9197228774de6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A26C50DF_DB4D_42CE_A9E4_DA805B929169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the kind of place you might assign someone to clean as part of their hazing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le genre d’endroit où on y envoyait en corvée de nettoyage les personnes qu’on voulait "
"bizuter."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15426fe8c9f08989c316d923fe969d657a72cf0c976ddff7a4e4f30027bb2805
#. default-sha256: 06cd8f55444246fb6c53a847f6a98c8ac970e610fe9387f0b5e12350e25823ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C75B4ECE_BC9F_41C8_A4D2_0EF2E18297BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anyway, ⟪k:1⟫when the maid realized the sound was coming from that particular hall, ⟪k:2⟫"
"she, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as you might expect, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫let out an uncomfortable sigh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bref, ⟪k:1⟫quand la servante s’est rendu compte que le bruit venait de ce couloir en "
"particulier, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫comme on peut s’y attendre, ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ elle a poussé un soupir, mal à "
"l’aise."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13d986e0475f5ab886e785466fa48dcb6ad2cbd36484884efa8d154b2c2ff06b
#. default-sha256: 138836d3ebf8ae8ae174d483e21a47c0f0a7134b1aca64e6ca02b4248a5a7a79
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93B3ABC0_B4DD_42C8_85AC_1D062CCD5393"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there might be a leak, ⟪k:1⟫and having noticed, ⟪k:2⟫she couldn’t simply ignore it, ⟪k:3⟫"
"you know?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il y avait peut-être une fuite, ⟪k:1⟫et comme elle l’avait remarquée, ⟪k:2⟫elle ne "
"pouvait pas tout simplement l’ignorer, ⟪k:3⟫tu comprends ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96797196c6bffa50e02385eeb9fa7663eff0a8d7a577d4fa8dc02ef8f5a4d4b4
#. default-sha256: b3569e32d6787957f76a4a6b0e8b0528b532017103478aded1c30ae8a0045164
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CC8E67E_AC08_46E9_AA96_498ADF5F22F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as much as she hesitated, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she pushed open the doors to the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Donc, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tout en hésitant, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫elle a ouvert la porte qui menait à ce couloir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51b257059a68acb2bc3037d93f29da3e8eb35c9f26600ec2aa88e9744032e058
#. default-sha256: ea43519b47ba546bd15e972211e6873391f285a95aed8e431ba329653870ceba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_929EC2E4_9487_41DB_B985_2B84615F0B67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was nobody there, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and it didn’t look like anything was leaking, "
"⟪k:5⟫either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il n’y avait personne, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫et rien ne semblait couler, ⟪k:5⟫non plus."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d3c8b7da3e420826797c6c0fd1bbd724e8104b84358304ff99944a06633dea0
#. default-sha256: 24ff6ba80dc711c5dfd6662fdc7473a7bbca45ba20a73c1fbf9f7360e98dd22d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9C6B3D19_44F9_4C43_B568_07FFC3049C94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There were no puddles ⟪k:1⟫or water stains ⟪k:2⟫anywhere to be found."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il n’y avait ni mare ⟪k:1⟫ni flaque d’eau ⟪k:2⟫nulle part."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a4993cdc0558580ed781f0f3867223bc4b97bfc9a3054c3b182b9f439a38480
#. default-sha256: 47cee5af5fc5ea375b55e3ed01724ddf305cf03cb9c5f5953593d37cb13df935
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C5891E68_E1A5_47F4_AF10_ADEEB3EB16A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But she could still hear the sound, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫drip, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫drip⟪k:8⟫, ⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫getting louder and louder."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mais elle entendait toujours le bruit, ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ploc, ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫ploc⟪k:8⟫, "
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫de plus en plus fort."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b97cc60468229b798cf124cbb061274514a401bab22d5564297b94e78831ffdc
#. default-sha256: fa3ee909042071fd0a45d3d8939a12f69893c8519be08556b3cf44b13a99efc1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6664CD0C_6260_4CEB_89D2_7EF9DD59AFA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Slowly stepping further into the room, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫looking left, ⟪k:3⟫then right, ⟪k:4⟫then "
"left again, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she searched for the source of the sound, ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫coming to a stop "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle s’est avancée lentement dans la pièce, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a regardé à gauche, ⟪k:3⟫puis à "
"droite, ⟪k:4⟫puis à nouveau à gauche, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫elle cherchait la source du bruit ⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"et a fini par s’arrêter en plein milieu du couloir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7910054bcee28c4255ec02b2b6abc9da56359e954828f18bcd87c9b6e14f115
#. default-sha256: f7c9de36e11f6b13646b8008317a4259ee5a522082e1d01c65a4ac2c4a4a9a6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03651C96_6874_4D7E_935B_1FC60862E4FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She stood there still, ⟪k:1⟫quiet, ⟪k:2⟫and then—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a chilly spot on the nape of her "
"neck."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle s’est immobilisée, ⟪k:1⟫en silence, ⟪k:2⟫et puis —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫elle a senti une goutte "
"glacée lui couler dans la nuque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a150268973130144a5fe27a2061ad32ca5c054833d99cdf76f1ac278e130fb2
#. default-sha256: a42815ab6bee955d4c475744273c4f216723568355996dd7ea57079ec23a96db
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_428935B6_6158_4AA4_85FE_FE38123D2D94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a little yelp, ⟪k:1⟫she reached back to feel her neck, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but it wasn’t wet."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En poussant un petit cri, ⟪k:1⟫elle a posé la main sur sa nuque, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫mais ce n’était "
"pas mouillé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9b7ce283537bc73546a32d10261d96b831aa49f00e65d425981efdc3d6402c7
#. default-sha256: 3cfad71c96aa7af404aeaed1e703ccd929fbc760e146d62dceb860606370751e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7EDA7217_4C19_473A_AAF8_9A5DBE86FB9D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Confused, ⟪k:1⟫she slowly, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫warily tilted her head backward..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perplexe, ⟪k:1⟫doucement, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫elle a prudemment levé la tête..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E1B1B5B_DE17_4A4D_A3AE_D65844474192
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d175aa952e997d1ed7010db3c5c68bdd50e02e0dfe070d90a36aef6a4f1cb29a
#. default-sha256: a04846f30e3207fb40c11c6fffda3b230a1a5a52a3e30482fb4fc8ad775efa4e
